WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:14.911
Aunt Sunny and her fiancé were waiting for us. Hello, there!

2
00:00:14.912 --> 00:00:17.288
Mom: Sunny!

3
00:00:17.289 --> 00:00:19.020
Sunny: Oh, Young-Hee.

4
00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:20.588
How have you been?

5
00:00:20.589 --> 00:00:25.636
Sunny: I am so glad you could come.

6
00:00:25.637 --> 00:00:27.993
Hana & Bada: Hello, Aunt Sunny.

7
00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:33.746
Sunny: Oh, my! Hana and Bada! Welcome, welcome!

8
00:00:33.747 --> 00:00:39.370
Sunny: Let me introduce you to my fiancé.

9
00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:41.531
His name is Tom Blake.

10
00:00:41.532 --> 00:00:45.212
Sunny: Tom, this is my best friend, Young-Hee.

11
00:00:45.213 --> 00:00:46.633
Tom: How do you do?

12
00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:48.587
Call me Tom.

13
00:00:48.588 --> 00:00:50.602
Mom: Nice to meet you, Tom.

14
00:00:50.603 --> 00:00:54.542
You can call me Young.

15
00:00:54.543 --> 00:00:58.091
Mom: These are my children, Hana and Bada.

16
00:00:58.092 --> 00:01:00.202
Tom: Beautiful names.

17
00:01:00.203 --> 00:01:02.874
Hello, Hana. Hello, Bada.

18
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:08.994
Hana & Bada: Hi. Hello.

19
00:01:08.995 --> 00:01:11.242
Sunny: Come on. Let's go home.

20
00:01:11.243 --> 00:01:13.430
You guys must be tired.

21
00:01:13.431 --> 00:01:16.495
Tom: Here. Let me take your bags.

22
00:01:16.496 --> 00:01:18.366
Mom: Thank you.

23
00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:23.701
Tom: Let's go to the parking lot.

24
00:01:23.702 --> 00:01:29.831
Bada couldn't take his eyes off the car.
